{"id":"wb-7-1023","name":"吴氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T06:20:01+00:00","status":"ready","title":"车塘村吴氏宗祠","text":"车塘村吴氏宗祠位于浙江省衢州市衢江区云溪乡。宗祠建于明嘉靖十二年（1532年），建筑面西，呈方形，为四面厅形式，前厅设有戏台。1989年12月12日被列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BD%A6%E5%A1%98%E6%9D%91%E5%90%B4%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":95325451,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95325451","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0770e3fa4c9cd2022e845e68.jpg","title":"Quzhou Chetang Wushi Zongci 2017.10.21 16-06-14.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quzhou_Chetang_Wushi_Zongci_2017.10.21_16-06-14.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/Quzhou_Chetang_Wushi_Zongci_2017.10.21_16-06-14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"衢州车塘吴氏宗祠","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"名称及地点核对一致"}}